-<!--                                                                      -->
-<!--  Test which verifies that the basic facilities of declarative        -->
-<!--  animation are working.                                              -->
-<!--                                                                      -->
-<!-- Author : Jon Ferraiolo 03-Apr-2000                                   -->
-<!--                                                                      -->
-<!-- History:                                                             -->
